# Reset Engineering Playbook (mandatory)

**Full document:** `docs/ENGINEERING_PLAYBOOK.md` — read it before writing or modifying code.

## Quick rules (non-negotiable)

### Architecture
- One codebase, reusable `ToolTemplate` — never fork tool layouts
- Pages in `app/`; UI in `components/`; logic in `lib/`; types in `types/`
- New tools: `lib/tools/[name]/calculate.ts` + `tools/[slug]/[Name]Tool.tsx` + registry entry in `lib/tools/registry.ts`
- **Never** create `app/tools/[slug]/page.tsx` per tool — dynamic route handles it
- No AI in tool logic; deterministic calculations only
- Tailwind + `components/ui` only — no MUI/Bootstrap

### Tool layout order (global — do not reorder)
Tool → Results → **App download** (tool-specific `appCta`, theme `#209EBB`, button `#023047` white uppercase, Google Play only) → **Newsletter** (centered) → Related tools → FAQ

### Tool requirements
- `appCta: { title, description }` must be **specific to the tool**
- Guidance `<Callout>` when inputs are non-obvious
- Pure calculation functions in `lib/` — no React in calculate.ts
- Pass `path`, `metadata`, `relatedTools`, `categoryName` from `ToolPageProps`

### SEO (every tool)
- Register with `title`, `description`, `keywords`, `category`, `slug`
- Use `createMetadata` via dynamic page — no per-tool metadata files
- FAQ ≥3 items for indexable tools; schema must match visible FAQ

### Code quality
- TypeScript strict; no `any`; use `@/` imports
- Minimal diff — match existing conventions
- Run `npm run lint` and `npm run build` before finishing
- Do not commit unless user explicitly asks

### Categories (only these)
`focus` | `productivity` | `planning` | `calculators`

### Slugs
kebab-case, intent/keyword-driven: `notification-cost-calculator`

When unsure, read `docs/ENGINEERING_PLAYBOOK.md` in full.
